/// **unmeasurable** when the join cannot decide: no ledger entry, a
/// founding-batch birthday (the survivor-trap guard — [`first_scored_age`] is
/// reused rather than re-derived), or an unorderable boundary (`"unknown"`,
/// the sentinel legacy snapshot lines carry).
fn verdict_for(
    path: &str,
    first_scored: &BTreeMap<String,String>,
    founding: Option<&str>,
    boundary_ts: &str,
) -> SurpriseVerdict
